-  - pinkie-pie (Prank accomplice / morale engine; trust=high): Pranks, parties and unexpected fourth options; Pinkie reads her moods before Rainbow has noticed them herself.
-- **Cross-team relationships:**
-  - spitfire (T4; trust=mixed): Rainbow resents being ordered and wants the nod anyway; she will follow Spitfire into a burning sky but argue about the route.
-  - scootaloo (T2; trust=high): Coach, camping mentor and rescue pilot in the Washouts affair; she is protective without ever admitting it out loud.
